.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-quotes-void-quote-version - Void a quote version


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago quotes void-quote-version  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint voids a quote version, which makes it definitive: a voided version can neither be edited nor approved again.
Only a \fBdraft\fR version can be voided through this endpoint, and the resulting \fBvoid_reason\fR is \fBmanual\fR\&. An \fBapproved\fR version is voided by Lago itself, through the order form generated from it.
A concurrent write on the same quote is reported as a \fB422\fR rather than retried, so a duplicated call can fail while the first one is still in flight.
This is a premium feature.


